{
  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified VAI 369 days before the shortage posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D8"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA first posted the clindamycin phosphate injection shortage on 2023-03-21 and it remains current as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E42"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The shortage listing includes Baxter Healthcare, Pfizer Inc., Sagent Pharmaceuticals, and Sandoz Inc. as affected companies.",
      "cites": ["E37", "E38", "E39", "E40"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Our Corvale East and Corvale Lakeside inventory both carry Sandoz Inc. product with NDC 0781-3288-09.",
      "cites": ["E1", "E8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The Sandoz label names InfoRLife SA as the manufacturing plant.",
      "cites": ["E9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1165537 at Bryant Ranch PrePack (FEI 1000519407) ended 2022-03-17 and was classified VAI, with the classification letter dated 2022-05-19 — 369 days before FDA posted the shortage on 2023-03-21.",
      "cites": ["D8", "E17"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has 6.2 days on hand of the 6 mg/mL 50 mL bags while Corvale Lakeside has 19.2 days.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The top-ranked option is to transfer 21 bags of 6 mg/mL 50 mL from Corvale Lakeside to Corvale East, which would raise Corvale East to 8 days on hand while Corvale Lakeside retains two weeks of supply.",
      "cites": ["D12"]
    }
  ]
}
